    slug: "1-Worklog/1.6-Week6",
    vi: {
      title: "Tuần 6: Amazon S3 và thao tác bằng AWS CLI",
      text: "**Thời gian:** 21/09/2026–25/09/2026.\n\n#### Mục tiêu\n\n- Hiểu bucket, object, key và tổ chức dữ liệu.\n- Biết đọc cú pháp CLI phục vụ quản lý S3.\n\n#### Nội dung đã tìm hiểu\n\n| Thứ | Nội dung học tập | Ngày bắt đầu | Ngày hoàn thành | Nguồn tài liệu |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | Đọc khái niệm object storage và các trường hợp sử dụng S3. | 21/09/2026 | 21/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/) |\n| 3 | Tìm hiểu bucket, Region, tên bucket và thiết lập khi tạo. | 22/09/2026 | 22/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/) |\n| 4 | Đọc luồng upload object và cách nhận biết dữ liệu trong bucket. | 23/09/2026 | 23/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/) |\n| 5 | Tìm hiểu AWS CLI, profile và tham số lựa chọn dịch vụ/Region. | 24/09/2026 | 24/09/2026 | [https://000011.awsfcaj.com/](https://000011.awsfcaj.com/) |\n| 6 | Đọc các ví dụ liệt kê, tải lên và sao chép object bằng CLI. | 25/09/2026 | 25/09/2026 | [https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/](https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/) |\n\n#### Kết quả học tập\n\n- Phân biệt object key với thư mục trên máy chủ.\n- Biết đọc thao tác Console/CLI và xác định bucket/key đích trước khi ghi.\n",
      html: '\u003ch1>Tuần 6: Amazon S3 và thao tác bằng AWS CLI\u003c/h1>\n\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Thời gian:\u003c/strong> 21/09/2026–25/09/2026.\u003c/p>\n\u003ch4>Mục tiêu\u003c/h4>\n\u003cul>\u003cli>Hiểu bucket, object, key và tổ chức dữ liệu.\u003c/li>\u003cli>Biết đọc cú pháp CLI phục vụ quản lý S3.\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n\u003ch4>Nội dung đã tìm hiểu\u003c/h4>\n\u003cdiv class="table-wrap">\u003ctable>\u003cthead>\u003ctr>\u003cth>Thứ\u003c/th>\u003cth>Nội dung học tập\u003c/th>\u003cth>Ngày bắt đầu\u003c/th>\u003cth>Ngày hoàn thành\u003c/th>\u003cth>Nguồn tài liệu\u003c/th>\u003c/tr>\u003c/thead>\u003ctbody>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>2\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Đọc khái niệm object storage và các trường hợp sử dụng S3.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>21/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>21/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>3\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Tìm hiểu bucket, Region, tên bucket và thiết lập khi tạo.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>22/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>22/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>4\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Đọc luồng upload object và cách nhận biết dữ liệu trong bucket.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>23/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>23/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>5\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Tìm hiểu AWS CLI, profile và tham số lựa chọn dịch vụ/Region.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>24/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>24/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000011.awsfcaj.com/">https://000011.awsfcaj.com/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>6\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Đọc các ví dụ liệt kê, tải lên và sao chép object bằng CLI.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>25/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>25/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/">https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/tbody>\u003c/table>\u003c/div>\n\u003ch4>Kết quả học tập\u003c/h4>\n\u003cul>\u003cli>Phân biệt object key với thư mục trên máy chủ.\u003c/li>\u003cli>Biết đọc thao tác Console/CLI và xác định bucket/key đích trước khi ghi.\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n',
    },
    en: {
      title: "Week 6: Amazon S3 and AWS CLI operations",
      text: "**Period:** 21/09/2026–25/09/2026.\n\n#### Learning objectives\n\n- Understand buckets, objects, keys and organization.\n- Read CLI syntax for S3 administration.\n\n#### Topics studied\n\n| Day | Learning activity | Start date | Completion date | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Monday | Read object-storage concepts and S3 use cases. | 21/09/2026 | 21/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/) |\n| Tuesday | Study bucket naming, Region and creation settings. | 22/09/2026 | 22/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/) |\n| Wednesday | Read object-upload flow and bucket object listings. | 23/09/2026 | 23/09/2026 | [https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/](https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/) |\n| Thursday | Study AWS CLI, profiles and service/Region options. | 24/09/2026 | 24/09/2026 | [https://000011.awsfcaj.com/](https://000011.awsfcaj.com/) |\n| Friday | Read CLI examples for listing, uploading and copying objects. | 25/09/2026 | 25/09/2026 | [https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/](https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/) |\n\n#### Learning outcomes\n\n- Distinguish object keys from server directories.\n- Read Console/CLI operations and identify targets before writing.\n",
      html: '\u003ch1>Week 6: Amazon S3 and AWS CLI operations\u003c/h1>\n\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Period:\u003c/strong> 21/09/2026–25/09/2026.\u003c/p>\n\u003ch4>Learning objectives\u003c/h4>\n\u003cul>\u003cli>Understand buckets, objects, keys and organization.\u003c/li>\u003cli>Read CLI syntax for S3 administration.\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n\u003ch4>Topics studied\u003c/h4>\n\u003cdiv class="table-wrap">\u003ctable>\u003cthead>\u003ctr>\u003cth>Day\u003c/th>\u003cth>Learning activity\u003c/th>\u003cth>Start date\u003c/th>\u003cth>Completion date\u003c/th>\u003cth>Source\u003c/th>\u003c/tr>\u003c/thead>\u003ctbody>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>Monday\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Read object-storage concepts and S3 use cases.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>21/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>21/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>Tuesday\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Study bucket naming, Region and creation settings.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>22/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>22/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.1-creates3bucket/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>Wednesday\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Read object-upload flow and bucket object listings.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>23/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>23/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/">https://000057.awsfcaj.com/2-prerequiste/2.2-uploaddata/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>Thursday\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Study AWS CLI, profiles and service/Region options.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>24/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>24/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000011.awsfcaj.com/">https://000011.awsfcaj.com/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003ctr>\u003ctd>Friday\u003c/td>\u003ctd>Read CLI examples for listing, uploading and copying objects.\u003c/td>\u003ctd>25/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>25/09/2026\u003c/td>\u003ctd>\u003ca href="https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/">https://000011.awsfcaj.com/5-s3/\u003c/a>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/tbody>\u003c/table>\u003c/div>\n\u003ch4>Learning outcomes\u003c/h4>\n\u003cul>\u003cli>Distinguish object keys from server directories.\u003c/li>\u003cli>Read Console/CLI operations and identify targets before writing.\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n',
    },
