      title: "Step 2",
      text: "\nThe full setup procedure and evidence for **Thu thập từng batch và kiểm liên kết discovery** are maintained in Vietnamese. Use the language selector to read the complete procedure.\n\n[Chapter contents](../)\n",
      html: '\u003cdiv class="workshop-preview">\u003cdiv class="workshop-preview-tools">\u003cbutton type="button" data-workshop-menu aria-label="Contents">☰ Contents\u003c/button>\u003ca href="#p0">Internship report\u003c/a>\u003cspan>›\u003c/span>\u003ca href="#p17">Workshop\u003c/a>\u003cspan>› 5.7.2\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003ch1>\n              \n              Step 2\n            \u003c/h1>\n          \n\n        \n\n\n\n\t\u003cp>The full setup procedure and evidence for \u003cstrong>Thu thập từng batch và kiểm liên kết discovery\u003c/strong> are maintained in Vietnamese. Use the language selector to read the complete procedure.\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>\u003ca href="../../../../en/5-workshop/5.7-itviec-collection/">Chapter contents\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfooter class=" footline" >\n\t\n\u003c/footer>\u003c/div>',
