      html: '\u003cdiv class="workshop-preview">\u003cdiv class="workshop-preview-tools">\u003cbutton type="button" data-workshop-menu aria-label="Contents">☰ Contents\u003c/button>\u003ca href="#p0">Internship report\u003c/a>\u003cspan>›\u003c/span>\u003ca href="#p17">Workshop\u003c/a>\u003cspan>› 5.9\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003ch1>\n              \n              Streamlit dashboard\n            \u003c/h1>\n          \n\n        \n\n\n\n\t\u003cp>This chapter covers \u003cstrong>Streamlit dashboard\u003c/strong> for the implemented Vietnam IT Job Market project. The complete setup procedure, commands and dated evidence are maintained in the Vietnamese companion.\u003c/p>\n\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href="../../../en/5-workshop/5.9-streamlit-dashboard/5.9.1-step1/">5.9.1. Kết nối nguồn dữ liệu và khởi chạy ứng dụng\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href="../../../en/5-workshop/5.9-streamlit-dashboard/5.9.2-step2/">5.9.2. Hiển thị KPI và biểu đồ Plotly\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href="../../../en/5-workshop/5.9-streamlit-dashboard/5.9.3-step3/">5.9.3. Tìm kiếm, lọc và xem chi tiết việc làm\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfooter class=" footline" >\n\t\n\u003c/footer>\u003c/div>',
